wing-order="1" hint="" /></node><node index="3" text="" resource-id="mode-study" class="android.widget.Button" package="com.sqldpass.app.adsqa" content-desc="학습 · 무제한" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="true" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[549,550][1032,694]" drawing-order="4" hint=""><node index="0" text="학습 · 무제한" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.sqldpass.app.adsqa" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[691,595][889,649]" drawing-order="1" hint="" /></node><node index="4" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.ViewGroup" package="com.sqldpass.app.adsqa" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[48,730][1032,1318]" drawing-order="5" hint="" /><node index="5" text="풀이 시간은 총 90분입니다. 일시정지하거나 앱을 벗어나면 남은 시간을 저장합니다." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.sqldpass.app.adsqa" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[93,775][987,943]" drawing-order="6" hint="" /><node index="6" text="돌아오면 이어서 풀기를 눌러 재개합니다. 일시정지 이력은 결과에 표시됩니다." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.sqldpass.app.adsqa" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[93,973][987,1093]" drawing-order="7" hint="" /><node index="7" text="두 모드 모두 최종 제출 후 정답과 해설을 확인합니다." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.sqldpass.app.adsqa" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[93,1123][987,1183]" drawing-order="8" hint="" /><node index="8" text="미응답은 0점입니다. 제출한 답안은 변경할 수 없습니다." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.sqldpass.app.adsqa" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[93,1213][987,1273]" drawing-order="9" hint="" /><node index="9" text="" resource-id="exam-rules" class="android.widget.Button" package="com.sqldpass.app.adsqa" content-desc="응시 기준 자세히" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="true" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="true" bounds="[48,1354][1032,1498]" drawing-order="10" hint=""><node index="0" text="응시 기준 자세히" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.sqldpass.app.adsqa" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="true" bounds="[393,1395][687,1458]" drawing-order="1" hint="" /></node><node index="10" text="문항당 2점. 총점 60점 이상, 1과목 4문항·2과목 16문항 이상 정답을 연습 기준으로 사용합니다. 실제 시험의 합격을 보장하지 않습니다." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.sqldpass.app.adsqa" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[48,1534][1032,1786]" drawing-order="11" hint="" /><node index="11" text="별도 표시가 없으면 Oracle Database 19c의 일반 관계형 테이블을 기준으로 합니다. SQL Server 문항은 명시합니다." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.sqldpass.app.adsqa" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[48,1822][1032,1942]" drawing-order="12" hint="" /><node index="12" text="각 문항의 표가 그 문항의 전체 데이터입니다. 이전 문항의 변경은 이어지지 않습니다. 별도 언급 없는 제약·트리거·숨은 데이터는 없습니다." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.sqldpass.app.adsqa" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[48,1978][1032,2043]" drawing-order="13" hint="" /><node index="13" text="문자 비교는 대소문자를 구분하는 이진 정렬을 가정합니다. 날짜 문항은 Gregorian 달력이고 DATE 리터럴은 자정입니다." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.sqldpass.app.adsqa" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[48,2194][1032,2043]" drawing-order="14" hint="" /><node index="14" text="여러 행은 명시된 ORDER BY 순서로 표시합니다. 값 목록의 괄호는 한 행이며 열 순서는 SELECT 목록을 따릅니다." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.sqldpass.app.adsqa" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[48,2350][1032,2043]" drawing-order="15" hint="" /><node index="15" text="소수 결과는 필요한 경우 소수 여섯째 자리까지 반올림하여 표기합니다. NULL은 실제 값 0이나 문자열 NULL과 다릅니다." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.sqldpass.app.adsqa" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[48,2506][1032,2043]" drawing-order="16" hint="" /><